## Performance Targets

### Good Performance Indicators
✅ **Query execution time**: < 2 seconds for complex operations  
✅ **Memory usage**: Stable, no exponential growth  
✅ **Database queries**: 5-20 queries instead of 50-100+  
✅ **No Cartesian products**: Result set size proportional to data  
✅ **No N+1 patterns**: Query count doesn't scale with collection size  

### When to Optimize Further
🔴 **Execution time**: > 10 seconds  
🔴 **Memory spikes**: > 500MB for single operation  
🔴 **Query count**: > 50 queries  
🔴 **Cartesian explosion**: Result rows >> actual entities  

